      "size": "lg",
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text-ms9nq5yy-2z039",
      "text": "Left: the 26 tools, seven read and nineteen write — none destructive. Right: one call followed end to end, from bearer token to the JSON reply. Every tool shapes arguments, calls the same service function a REST route calls, and returns JSON; agents create and refine, people destroy and share.",
